      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fetching a basic Island instead of Watery Grave means the player won't have access to black mana on turn 2. With Psychic Frog (UB) in hand as one of the best early plays available, having black mana is important. The player already has an untapped land from turn 1 (likely producing blue), and getting Watery Grave untapped (paying 2 life) would enable casting Psychic Frog this turn. A basic Island only provides blue mana, which they likely already have.",
