    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Evoking or casting Solitude when the opponent has no creatures on the battlefield wastes a premium removal spell for no value. Meanwhile, the player desperately needs to develop mana - they only have 1 Island in play with expensive cards in hand (Psychic Frog, Quantum Riddler, etc). Missing the land drop by not playing Flooded Strand sets them further behind on mana development.",
