      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With Psychic Frog (UB) and Quantum Riddler (3UU) in hand, plus two Force of Negations that need blue cards to exile, the player needs both blue and black mana. They already have an Island on the battlefield. Fetching a basic Plains provides white mana but doesn't help cast anything in their hand. Fetching Watery Grave (paying 2 life) would give access to black mana for Psychic Frog on turn 3, which is the most important early play. Alternatively, Hallowed Fountain could provide blue+white, but white isn't needed for anything in hand. The basic Plains is essentially a dead mana source since nothing in hand requires white mana, while black mana is critically needed for Psychic Frog.",
